{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"access","value":"https://gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772 (query endpoint: /772/query?where=1=1&outFields=*&f=json); public layer list at /IView2/MapServer/layers","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"auth","value":"none - confirmed public, no token required, standard Esri REST JSON","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"cost","value":"free, public municipal GIS layer","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"data_provided","value":"49 fields incl. request_num, permission_num, permission_date, addresses, building_num, yechidot_diyur, building_stage (status: בתהליך היתר/היתר קיים/בבניה/תעודת גמר/אכלוס), tr_hathalat_bniya, sug_bakasha (request type, free text), tochen_bakasha (request content, free text), occupation (טופס אכלוס date = form-4), finished (תאריך גמר). Verified via live query, sample record oid=1: request_num 20190001, address 'עבד אל ראוף אלביטאר 12', sug_bakasha 'בניה חדשה בניין מגורים לא גבוה', status 'בתהליך היתר', date_import 17/07/2026 (today, confirms daily/live sync)","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"spatial","value":"yes - esriGeometryPolygon (building footprint), spatialReference ITM WKID 2039, queryable/exportable via ArcGIS REST (f=geojson or f=json)","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"cross_ref_key","value":"address (addresses field, free text) + building_num (internal building code); no gush/helka field observed in 49 fields; ITM polygon geometry allows spatial join to facility lat/lng","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"update_cadence","value":"observed date_import on sample record = 17/07/2026 (today's date) - indicates daily or near-real-time sync from municipal licensing system; no formal Frequency metadata field (raw ArcGIS service, not CKAN)","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"sports_filterable","value":"partial - no coded-domain use-type field; sug_bakasha and tochen_bakasha are free-text (4000 char) request-description fields likely naming facility type in prose, so only a client-side text LIKE filter (ספורט/בריכה/מגרש/אולם) works, not a clean coded facet","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"israel_coverage","value":"single authority - Tel Aviv-Yafo only","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
{"_t":"finding","entity":"Tel Aviv GIS IView2 MapServer layer 772 (בקשות והיתרי בניה)","field":"reliability","value":"official municipal GIS; underlying feed behind public UI at tel-aviv.gov.il/Residents/Construction/Pages/LocatingRequest.aspx, cross-referenced by nadlancenter.co.il coverage of TLV Open Data launch (2023); no documented ToS/rate-limit found, treat as best-effort municipal service","source_key":"gisn.tel-aviv.gov.il/arcgis/rest/services/IView2/MapServer/772"}
